Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.75,0:00:11.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?\NWhat a tasty morsel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:14.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now eat your fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:23.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,64.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.58,0:01:21.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,604.8)}{\an7}The Empress of the Park and the Demonic Dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:22.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Check out that lady, she's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:23.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wow, no kidding...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:26.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rawr! I'm gonna eat'cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:30.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're so full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:32.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Staaaaaaaare.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.63,0:01:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,The hell are you jerks starin' at?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:37.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've heard that female Ogres\Nhave strong maternal instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.17,0:01:40.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess that holds true\Neven for alcoholics like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.13,0:01:44.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold up! Th-this has nothing to do with me\Nliking kids, I just think they're cute and-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.17,0:01:47.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, Ogres have a soft spot for kids, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:48.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh shaddup!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa there. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.83,0:01:52.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Getting into a huff here will just make\Nall the kids laugh at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:53.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:55.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Speaking of, where'd they all go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.92,0:01:56.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.25,0:01:59.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're on my turf!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.54,0:02:02.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you wanna pway awound here,\Nthen you gotta pay up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Omigod! How can something be this cute?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.92,0:02:09.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whuz the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.75,0:02:12.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stowp goofin' around and\Nfowk over da goods!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:14.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,This brat doesn't know any manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.71,0:02:16.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should come down on her\Nlike a ton of bricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.79,0:02:20.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! It's normal for kids\Nto have a little sass!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:22.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seeing you with such a goofy look\Nis kinda freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.88,0:02:26.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,This kid needs to learn how to\Nproperly interact with her betters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.58,0:02:30.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You down't get to wecture me! Bam! Bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.08,0:02:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Get your fat ass outta here, dumptwuck!\NBam! Bam! Bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.88,0:02:35.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kuroeda?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.33,0:02:36.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Bad girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.46,0:02:38.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Violence is a no-no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.71,0:02:42.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lemme go! How are you so stwong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:48.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, your name is Kobo, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:50.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's MISS Kobo to you, bowl cut boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:51.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,U-uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.83,0:02:54.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you always extort people\Nwhen you're at the park?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:58.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's my turf! So I can do whaddeva\NI want to make a pwofit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:00.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:04.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The payments I cowwected fwom the kidz\Nwho came to pway in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:11.63,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(998.4,259.2)}{\an7}SMIIIIIRK
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:08.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,But none of them couwd pay the extwa
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.09,0:03:08.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,for bawck taxes from befowe I came,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.25,0:03:10.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I kicked them all outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:11.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,What a slumlord...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:15.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's not nice.\NStealing from others is a no-no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.38,0:03:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.13,0:03:22.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, the twuth is I got\Nabandoned by my pawents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.50,0:03:27.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,They weft me starving on the stweets,\Nso I did it to survive...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.00,0:03:30.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You know we can see the eyedrops.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.92,0:03:34.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, you poor thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:35.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You believed that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.83,0:03:38.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay! Let me take care of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.75,0:03:40.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be your mommy now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.79,0:03:44.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lay off! You're bweaking my bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:51.08,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(691.2,439.2)}{\an7}Fries 4 Life
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:48.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell\Nsomeone starving for food
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:51.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,would have bulging curves\Nof flab on them like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:52.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.63,0:03:55.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hate people talking abouwt my fwab!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:03:59.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just wook at that ugwy sack of fat\Nyou call a stomach!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:01.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna smack the hell outta it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:05.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn. She dodged.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.33,0:04:06.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.71,0:04:08.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's a Kobold sprite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.71,0:04:11.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,They have the physical appearance of kids,\Nbut this is actually a full-grown adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.75,0:04:12.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:14.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Elves, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:16.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I shouwd've known fwom how slow you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:20.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,And having that ugwy sack of fat\Njuwst makes you an even bigger slowpoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.08,0:04:21.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Elves aren't slowpokes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:24.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good wuck hitting me with those awwows!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.38,0:04:26.58,Q5,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Quit scampering around!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.38,0:04:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon! Whuz the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:27.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll never hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:31.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Butterballs like you couwd never hope\Nto pull off moves wike this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:35.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aw crap...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no escape for you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.25,0:04:43.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't bewieve this lard bucket of an Elf\Ngot the bettew of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.21,0:04:47.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's onwy cuz eating all the stupid candies\Nfwom the kidz made me fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:49.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,They'd never beat me if I couwd\Nget bawck into shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:53.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miss Kobo, would you like me to\Nteach you some facial exercises
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.38,0:04:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,to help improve your jawline?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:56.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seriouswy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.83,0:04:58.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,But on one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:01.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,No more misbehaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:03.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Does that sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:05.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,All wight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:12.25,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(665.6,93.6)}{\an7}Lick\N{\pos(832,144)}{\an7}Lick
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:09.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Making broad motions with\Nyour mouth and tongue
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,will help to stimulate\Nthe muscles in your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.67,0:05:14.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,And despite differences in physique,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.33,0:05:16.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,even people with smaller faces\Ncan benefit from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:20.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Face lifting massages\Nare also very beneficial.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:23.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here's how you do it. Just stretch like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.46,0:05:26.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:28.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Make these part of your daily routine
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:30.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,and the contours of your face\Nwill be sharper in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.33,0:05:33.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I kept my end of the deal.\NSo please keep your promise, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:35.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,All wight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:37.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,A few days later...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:41.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-what the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.25,0:05:43.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:47.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. After I did sowme dieting\Nand impwoved my wooks,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:49.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,these kids gave me pwesents voluntarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:51.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Being popular makes life such a bweeze\Nit's awmost annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:53.96,Q5,,0,0,0,,Wow! She looks even more precious now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:53.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Being popular makes life such a bweeze\Nit's awmost annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:57.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm keeping my pwomise. No misbehaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:06:00.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hewp me again the next time\NI put on weight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:03.88,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(921.6,460.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:02.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus-Sized Elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:06.50,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,86.4)}{\an7}Massage Relaxation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:06.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You had French fries again, didn't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.83,0:06:10.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um, well, they started selling\Nthis limited-time flavor...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.58,0:06:12.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,and I couldn't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:16.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sounds like we need to ban you\Nfrom eating fries for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:19.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh! Nuh-uh! Nuh-uh! Nuh-uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:21.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't live without fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:23.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aw jeez, let go! You're freaking me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:24.00,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,453.6)}{\an7}Squish
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Squish?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.29,0:06:28.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:29.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,a toxic waist!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:31.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, we only say that about "waste"!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.04,0:06:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it just me or are you getting fat, Human?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:35.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll slim down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.75,0:06:39.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know that it's my responsibility as\Nyour instructor to stay in good shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:40.50,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(499.2,604.8)}{\an7}Tater Town
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:43.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll start my mornings with\Na cup of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:45.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then have a well-balanced,\Nlow-calorie breakfast
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.79,0:06:48.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,filled with fermented foods\Nand dietary fiber.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:51.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Add in a moderate amount of exercise
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:53.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,and my body should naturally\Nget back into proper shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I put on MORE weight?! But how?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.25,0:06:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I must be cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.04,0:07:01.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen if I keep\Nputting on weight like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.13,0:07:11.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Human. This mountain of\NFrench fries is just for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.42,0:07:13.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Have as many as you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:15.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, thanks. I'm on a diet-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:17.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:19.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eat your fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:26.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just a nightmare. Thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.33,0:07:28.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.13,0:07:29.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the actual hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.58,0:07:31.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why am I eating all this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:33.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh? That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.46,0:07:35.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nobody ever breaks free from my spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:41.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anyways, just keeping eating\Nand satisfy your hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.21,0:07:43.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's all my home cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:44.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.67,0:07:46.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,And why are you in my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:48.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't pay any attention to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:51.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stay focused on your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:54.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? I can't control my body...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:56.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good boy. Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.88,0:07:59.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Say "ahhh".
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:00.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,My magic got negated!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.96,0:08:04.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Human?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's you two! What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:12.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,We sensed very faint traces of a spell\Nthat had been used on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.33,0:08:14.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,So we secretly kept an eye on you\Nfor any funny business!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.25,0:08:17.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What are filthy Elves doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:18.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's a Satyr!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:22.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're a race of creatures who mainly feed\Noff the avarice that radiates from others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:34.33,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(908.8,64.8)}{\an7}Hunger
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:34.33,Q12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(384,115.2)}{\an7}Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:34.33,Q13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(627.2,165.6)}{\an7}Radiates
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:34.33,Q14,,0,0,0,,{\pos(563.2,288)}{\an7}Avarice
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:27.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,She used hypnosis magic to\Nforcibly provoke your appetite
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.29,0:08:29.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,and made you eat a bunch of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:32.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then fed off the avarice that exuded off you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:34.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It explains why you suddenly got fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:36.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, now that I'm here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.58,0:08:38.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now that I'M here,\Nyou have nothing to worry about!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.83,0:08:42.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't steal my line,\Nyou fat pig of an Elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:44.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not my problem,\Nyou inky-ass blubberbutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:47.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:50.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dinner time is when I get to make\Npractical use of my favorite hobby
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:51.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,and I won't let you ruin it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.75,0:08:52.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Hobby"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.25,0:08:56.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes. My hobby is cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:59.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The cuisine of this world\Nis rich with variety.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.63,0:09:04.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have nothing but respect for how\Nvoracious humans get with their food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:06.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's helped me to sharpen my cooking skills
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:08.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,while simultaneously indulging\Nin tasty avarice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.21,0:09:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,D-do you feed off people's\Ncarnal desires, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.33,0:09:15.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, get your lewd thoughts out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:18.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh oh! The Human's getting beaten up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.13,0:09:19.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,We have to rescue him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:20.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,No can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.58,0:09:24.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,All that fighting earlier strained my panties\Nto the point they'll snap if I even move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.96,0:09:28.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Get away from the human,\Nyou gluttonous Satyr bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:29.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm putting a stop to your rampage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.71,0:09:33.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? You're the one who looks like\Na glutton around here, fatty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.71,0:09:34.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:37.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're clearly leading a life of\Nindulgence with no self-control.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.92,0:09:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,And that's no different from what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.21,0:09:42.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Enough talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.75,0:09:44.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Screw you and your slutty apron!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:47.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:50.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is what you get for\Nmaking fun of my outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:52.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:56.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha. Just look at all that flab on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:09:59.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:04.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now sit back and watch\Nas I fatten up the human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:05.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,My body's moving on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eat your fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.75,0:10:10.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Argh! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.21,0:10:17.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can move again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:19.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.71,0:10:21.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good job, blubberbutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.54,0:10:22.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:28.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go figure.\NLooks like you're a chubbo, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.71,0:10:33.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Except you got fat off avarice,\Nwhich is like air that nobody can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:35.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that make you a balloon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.21,0:10:39.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Human!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:43.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,No man has seen my naked body before!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:45.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You ruined my first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:49.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the end of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:50.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her panties are torn apart...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:53.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, it's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:56.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Satyrs have a strong attachment\Nto their prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:58.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,She'll be back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:11:00.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, here's my idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.96,0:11:07.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,After that, everyone started to\Ntake turns protecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.83,0:11:11.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Try this on for size!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.17,0:11:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're still adorable,\Neven if you are an adult!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.63,0:11:16.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love these chubby cheeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.08,0:11:19.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lemme go! I'm owder than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.17,0:11:20.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? You are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.96,0:11:25.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wah! I lost to blubberbutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:26.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanna rematch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:28.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're never going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.79,0:11:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a little rowdy, but now I can\Ncontinue my diet without worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:38.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will have my revenge!
